==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**25,900 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
**26,000 grants +1 Rare Ticket.
**26,100 grants +5 Legend Rare Catseyes.
*Added the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] to international versions.
*Added 2 new [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orb]] types:
**'''Cost Down''' (生産コスト割引, ''Seisan Kosuto Waribiki''): Every second unit deployed has a 5-30% cost discount.
**'''Resist Surges''' (烈波ダメージ耐性, ''Retsu Nami Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Surge Attack]]s by 5-50%. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Surges Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Surges Orb and a level 10 Resist Surge [[Talents|Talent]].
*Renamed "Eva Angel Killer" to "EVA Angel Killer" and all Eva units to EVA units.
*[[Treasure Festival]]s no longer appear in stages where Superior [[Treasure]]s have already been obtained.
*Events such as the [[Underground Labyrinth]], Treasure Festivals, and [[Zombie Outbreaks]] now appear on the top-left corner of the screen, instead of [[Splash Text]] from the Menu Cat.
*Changed the descriptions of [[Hippoe]], [[Squire Rel]] and [[Teacher Bear]] as well as [[Summerluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Summerluga]]'s Korean description.

